      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is possible now via SDK3 stations, as the station controller replaces the avatar controller while the player is in that station. As such, you can use the tracking state behavior to turn off IK for players completely in SDK3 stations.\nYou will need to import both the SDK3 for avatars and worlds into the same project, as you'll need to create an avatar controller for the station that includes the tracking override.",
