  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With more Udon worlds, we see more vehicles and aircrafts, and also more rollercoasters worlds.... Nice!\nBUT!\nThe seating function in these moving objects is still BAD. If you go down too fast, your avatar will flipped up, blocking your vision.\nSame if you go back, avatar will also move there.\nONLY head/feets and hands stays on place, that is weird.\nThis is why i need body lock function on VRC Stations. This function will remove the dynamic effect in lower body and will use only seating animation, ignoring normal movements (only head, hands and feets (with arms and legs) will move, but the (upper and) lower body will stick firmly on the VRC Station, no matter which movement you have.\n\nThis special lock feature will solve many problems in all moving objects and it will not block your vision due your avatar flipped up. \n\nActually, it's just stupid and weird why there is no good locking feature. We all know the annoying problem your avatar will flap up in all directions if you're going (too) fast.\n\nIf you can add this feature on VRC Station, we all will have much more fun with all moving objects! Really, way better, and way better for recording actions (like make movies) too. Way better for streamers, because it looks much less awkward. I know it's very long old issue, but it should wonderful if you can make it possible!",
